<style>
  .panel-root { flex-direction: column; width: 62; padding-top: 2.4; padding-bottom: 2.4; padding-left: 2.8; padding-right: 2.8; background-color: #0b0d12ff; border-color: #4a4b4f; border-width: 0.1; border-radius: 0.5; }
  .eyebrow { font-size: 1.3; font-weight: 700; color: #b9b5ab; margin-bottom: 0.5; }
  .heading { font-size: 2.4; font-weight: 700; color: #EEE9DF; margin-bottom: 0.7; }
  .hint { font-size: 1.6; color: #b9b5ab; margin-bottom: 1; }
  .btn { width: 100%; height: 3.8; background-color: #EEE9DF; border-radius: 0.4; justify-content: center; align-items: center; color: #0b0d12; font-size: 1.7; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 0.7; }
  .btn-disabled { width: 100%; height: 3.2; background-color: #1c2029; border-radius: 0.4; justify-content: center; align-items: center; color: #EEE9DF; font-size: 1.5; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 0.7; }
  .result { font-size: 1.7; color: #EEE9DF; margin-top: 0.6; }
  .gloss { font-size: 1.45; color: #8f8c85; }
</style>
<div class="panel-root" id="portable-root" style="display: none">
  <span class="eyebrow">VERIFICATION INSTRUMENT</span>
  <span class="heading">Export and verify</span>
  <span class="hint" id="pi-hint">export the field as a sealed bundle; the verdict shown is what an independent verifier process printed</span>
  <button class="btn" id="pi-export">Export &amp; Verify Bundle</button>
  <button class="btn-disabled" id="pi-download">Download bundle.json</button>
  <span class="gloss">a second, separate program checks this file - not the one that made it</span>
  <span class="result" id="pi-result">​</span>
</div>
